   unlikely{''} and ``very/somewhat unlikely{''} as their perception of
   addictiveness of hookah had an older age of initiation, with an HR: 0.75
   (95\% CI: 0.67-0.83) and an HR: 0.55 (95\% CI: 0.47, 0.63)
   respectively.Discussion Perceptions of the harmfulness and addictiveness
   of these tobacco products (TPs) should be addressed in education
   campaigns for youth to prevent early ages of initiation of cigarettes
   and hookah.},
